From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SuperKali <hello@superkali.me>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 13:06:42 +0200
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: sc8280xp: add complete thermal zones

The mainline description exposes only a subset of SC8280XP sensors,
while the Q8B vendor kernel publishes CPU, GPU, PCIe, memory, audio and
remote-processor zones. Add the complete sensor map so thermal
monitoring and mitigation match the vendor baseline.

(cherry picked from commit 5266e2bcd029f9756425c06cd1fdce7e2cd1599a)
Signed-off-by: SuperKali <hello@superkali.me>
